@startuml
[*] --> InitialState
InitialState --> AddingExpense : Add New Expense
AddingExpense --> SortingExpenses : Sort Expenses
AddingExpense --> SearchingExpenses : Search for Expense
SortingExpenses --> ViewingSummary : View Summary
SearchingExpenses --> ViewingSummary : View Summary
ViewingSummary --> [*] : End Process
ViewingSummary --> ViewingSummary : Continue Viewing
@enduml
